ly violent in a quest he can't name - a quest that slowly begins to undermine his certainties.","tagline":"An Obsession Out of Control"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Martin, professeur de philosophie à l’université, en pleine dépression, rencontre dans des circonstances étranges Cécilia, à l'origine de la mort d'un vieux peintre. Il va vivre avec cette jeune fille, qui oscille entre pureté et indifférence, une passion charnelle et orageuse, et malgré lui il va prendre la place du vieux peintre. Son ancienne compagne devient une confidente un peu cruelle et la spectatrice privilégiée de cette passion qui détruit une à une ses certitudes.","tagline":"Une obsession hors de contrôle"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uOX5IGE3wHSq83rSa1tLb70XjPB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qD3iptcv51gqYQiW4qPdwhyXN8A.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":55107,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uOX5IGE3wHSq83rSa1tLb70XjPB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uOX5IGE3wHSq83rSa1tLb70XjPB.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uOX5IGE3wHSq83rSa1tLb70XjPB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uOX5IGE3wHSq83rSa1tLb70XjPB.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xRKV8mc3a5OLRBp4srX7PX8TKVU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xRKV8mc3a5OLRBp4srX7PX8TKVU.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xvu2D0pW6Js10ONu1We64DBfBFp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xvu2D0pW6Js10ONu1We64DBfBFp.jpg","language":"en","width":